# Godot's editor from the same release on the same platform: it imports a
# project's assets and exports its pack (--headless --import, --export-pack),
# and draws its own window on the page, or on the X server DISPLAY names.
# Without Basis Universal, whose encoder names a header of Linux's that
# Emscripten's libc and Dolly's leave out (sys/timex.h), Jolt Physics, which
# knows WebAssembly only as Emscripten (3D physics is Godot's own), and the
# JSON-RPC module, whose one user is the GDScript language server: it listens
# on TCP, which Dolly does not have.
